== Walkthrough ==
You can find [[Feren]] on a boat in the wharf, fishing.  Get into his boat with him and hail him.  He says he enjoys fishing but is forever haunted by a vicious fish named Razortooth that continues to nibble at his boat and eat his catch.

Feren - loc is -738.92, -199.34, 5.80  - Kerra Isle

'''It is possible to do the turn-in on apprehensive faction. It is not confirmed whether the quest can be done at lower faction.'''

You say, 'Hail, Feren'

: Feren says, 'Rarr.  Me is Feren.  Me is fisher.  That means Feren catches [fish].'

You say, 'fish'

: Feren says, 'All kinds of fish.  Tasty fish.  All day Feren catches the fishes so all Kerran can eat.  I do for good of all Kerran.  Rrrrr.  One thing bother Feren always though.  Is bad fish.  [Razortooth].'

You say, 'Razortooth'

: Feren says, 'Rrrrrr!  Razortooth mean fish.  Razortooth eat fish off Feren's line.  Razortooth gnaw Feren's boat.  Razortooth smart and dangerous.  Feren never able to catch Razortooth.  This haunt Feren for months.  If you was able to catch Razortooth, Feren be forever grateful. Maybe even give you possessions.'

''' You have been assigned the task 'Razortooth'. ''' <br>
Feren, a fisher of Kerra Isle, has been having trouble bringing enough fish back tot he village lately. He told you that a particularly nasty fish in the lake has been harassing him and stealing the fish right off of his line. He's dubbed this fish 'Razortooth' and needs your help to catch him. He'll also need a little extra help from you if he's going to provide enough fresh fish to feed the village.

